:false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102045","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102045","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102045.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102045.patch","merged_at":"2025-01-27T15:51:06Z"},"body":"- Fixes #102039\r\n\r\nThe error was introduced in the PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101895 on Linux when using the `Stop` button when the game is embedded. When using the `Stop` button the game process is killed and the window id becomes invalid. Even with the `XSetErrorHandler(&bad_window_error_handler)`, the error is thrown on the next x11 call. Adding a little check to see if the window is still valid before executing the `XSendEvent` fixed the issue.\r\n\r\nThe error was:\r\n```\r\nINTERNAL ERROR: Unhandled XServer error: BadWindow (invalid Window parameter)\r\n   Major opcode of failed request: 25\r\n   Serial number of failed request: 0\r\n   Current serial number in output stream: 8195764\r\n```\r\n\r\nCC @YeldhamDev","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","s